{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">由中石化營運，全港首個油站轉型為純充電站於九龍灣啟用。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">純充電站位於啟福道，前身是蜆殼油站，提供20個快充車位，當中6個是超快充電。指定車型最快只需10分鐘，由兩成電量充至八成，每度電收費1.68元。每日下午3至6時的高峰時段，會為巴士、小巴和的士劃定充電區。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PIT-1130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026clB8Z7HdTd1788152658.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PIT-1130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而為方便粵車南下的司機，充電站設8個車位同時配備國標及歐標充電槍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T05:19:52.527603+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}